        "alt": "花火の下、二人分の影が並ぶ"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭を、うしろと回ることになった。「二人で」と言うべきか、少し迷う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼はいつも、私の背後にいる。振り向いても、背後にいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "並んで歩くという概念に、今夜、初めて挑戦してもらう。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "挑戦は、三歩で終わった。気づけば、背後にいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「並ぶのは、落ち着かない」と、うしろの声が言う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "分かりました。では今夜は、背中で会話する祭りにしましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.002d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.002d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私が前、あなたが後ろ。定位置で、行きましょう。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "定位置は、思ったより快適だった。りんご飴を買うと、背後から手が伸びて受け取る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "人混みでは、背中がぶつからない。夜店の写真屋の前を通ったら、店主が叫んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お客さん、うしろの人も写ってるよ、全部の写真に」知ってます。百二十七枚、全部に。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "花火の残りが、二、三発だけ上がる夜だった。光が開くたび、石畳に影が伸びる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の影の隣に、もう一つの影。……影は、並んでいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "本人は背後でも、影は隣に並ぶらしい。ずるい並び方だ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道の橋の上で、うしろの声が言った。「明日、決勝だ」はい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「おれは、背中を守るのが仕事だ」「……だから、ミミは、前だけ見ていればいい」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……今、名前で呼ばれた。監督、ではなく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "振り向きそうになるのを、こらえる。耳の先が、かっと熱い。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "振り向かずに、ありがとうございますと言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "返事の代わりに、提灯の灯りがひとつ、ふっと揺れた。照れているんだと思う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "背後の気配で分かるくらいには、私もこの定位置に慣れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "別れ際——三秒、彼は正面に立った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "まっすぐ目が合って、「明日、勝とう」と言って、また背後に戻った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三秒の正面は、この人の最大級だ。私は今夜の三秒を、手帳に書かずに、覚えておくことにした。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.ushiro.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
